{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: LLM基础MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"什么是 RoPE 旋转位置编码？相比其他位置编码有什么优势？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LLM基础与Prompt工程\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/LLM基础\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">LLM基础MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"什么是 RoPE 旋转位置编码？相比其他位置编码有什么优势？\" dir=\"auto\">什么是 RoPE 旋转位置编码？相比其他位置编码有什么优势？</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">什么是 RoPE（旋转位置编码）？它如何解决位置编码问题？相比 sin/cos 绝对位置编码和 ALiBi 有什么优势？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、为什么需要位置编码</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Transformer 的 Self-Attention 是<strong>置换不变</strong>的（位置盲）：输入\"我打你\"和\"你打我\"算出来的注意力是一样的。必须显式注入位置信息。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、三种位置编码对比</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码类型</th>\n<th>核心机制</th>\n<th>相对位置能力</th>\n<th>长文本外推</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>绝对位置编码 (sin/cos)</td>\n<td>加性位置向量</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>BERT, GPT-2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RoPE (旋转位置编码)</td>\n<td>旋转矩阵作用于 Q/K</td>\n<td>强（自然表示）</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>LLaMA, Qwen, Mistral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ALiBi</td>\n<td>注意力分数加线性偏置</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>BLOOM</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三、RoPE 核心原理</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">RoPE 通过对每个 token 的 Query 和 Key 向量施加一个<strong>与位置相关的旋转矩阵</strong>，使得两个 token 的注意力分数只依赖于它们的相对位置差。</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> torch\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">apply_rotary_emb</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>x<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> cos<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> sin<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"RoPE 核心实现\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 将特征维度分成两半</span>\n    half_dim <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> x<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>shape<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">//</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span>\n    x1<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> x2 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> x<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>half_dim<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> x<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> half_dim<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 旋转操作</span>\n    rotated_x <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> torch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>cat<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span>x2<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> x1<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> dim<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 结合 cos/sin 变换</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>x <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> cos<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>rotated_x <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> sin<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 关键特性：</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># ⟨RoPE(q, m), RoPE(k, n)⟩ = f(q, k, m-n)</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 内积结果只依赖于位置差 (m-n)，完美体现相对位置</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>四、RoPE 的 4 大核心特性</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>平移不变性</strong>：相对位置相同的 token，旋转后的关系相同</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>长度扩展性</strong>：旋转角度通过公式动态计算，支持远超训练长度的序列</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>线性计算复杂度</strong>：旋转操作逐向量进行，复杂度 O(n)</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>远程衰减</strong>：高频维度对短距离敏感，低频维度对长距离敏感，整体注意力衰减</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>五、RoPE 在长文本中的扩展</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 位置插值 (Position Interpolation)</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 训练长度 4096，推理长度 8192</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 将新位置映射到原来的频率范围</span>\nrotary_base <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">10000</span>\nscale_factor <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">8192</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> <span class=\"token number\">4096</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 2.0</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 实际旋转角度 = 原角度 / scale_factor</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># NTK-aware 扩展：更平滑的频率调整</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># YaRN：结合温度缩放，128K 上下文扩展的最佳实践</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"RoPE 到底是绝对位置编码还是相对位置编码？\"</strong> — 严格来说是相对位置编码，因为内积只依赖于位置差。但参数是绝对位置（每个位置有唯一旋转角度）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"训练 4K，推理 8K 怎么办？\"</strong> — 直接外推可能有效，但更好的做法是位置插值或 YaRN</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">❌ \"RoPE 是加性位置编码\" — RoPE 是乘法（矩阵旋转），不是加法</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">❌ \"RoPE 可以解决任意长度\" — 外推能力有限，超长需要配合插值或微调</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">LLM基础MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}